#. y1:english="dummy\nStaminan Royal.||Recovers HP and increases spirit greatly.\nStaminan X.||Recovers HP and increases spirit slightly.\nStaminan XX.||Recovers HP and increases spirit moderately.\nTauriner.||You can sustain HEAT mode for a short time.\nTauriner +. You can sustain HEAT mode||for a moderate amount of time.\nTauriner ++. You can sustain HEAT mode||for a long time.\nIn winter, this Japanese stew set is the||dish of choice. It's filling and good.\nA salmon rice ball. It's good since it can||be eaten at any time, but one is not enough.\nA standard lunch box.||The volume is just right.\nA club sandwich. Not very filling but||good even when it's cold.\nSpecial fried noodles. I got them heated up,||but they taste okay cold too.\nA meat bun. A great snack in the winter.||I wouldn't eat it cold though.\nThe hefty special burger.||It's double stacked and really filling.\nThe hamburger, synonymous with fast food.||I prefer eating it hot.\nThe fish burger. It's healthier than the meat counterpart.||A once-in-a-while sort of food..\nFrench fries, solid calories. Not good||for your complexion, but a decent pick-me-up.\nRegular size beef bowl takeout lunch box.||Best eaten while hot.\nLarge beef bowl takeout lunch box.||It's really filling but doesn't taste good cold.\nExtra large beef bowl takeout lunch box.||It's really filling but doesn't taste good cold.\n-\n-\n-\n-\nRegular size beef bowl.||Not quite filling enough.\nLarge beef bowl.||Quite a substantial portion.\nExtra large beef bowl.||The perfect amount.\nTokyo style soy sauce based ramen.||A simple taste that you'll never grow tired of.\nHas stewed pork slices as a topping.||It's pretty filling.\nA great dish with a home-made won ton topping.||It's quite filling.\nThe password I was given.||I wonder if I can actually order it...\nThe hefty special burger.||It's double stacked and really filling.\nSynonymous with fast food.||I prefer eating it hot.\nThey say it's healthier than the meat counterpart.||It's a once-in-a-while sort of food..\nPacked with carbohydrates and fat. Bad for your||complexion but a good energy boost.\nModeled from a chick called Piyo-chan.||A small yellow stuffed animal.\nModeled on a silky fowl chick called Ukoppiyo.||A small black stuffed animal.\nApparently, a stuffed animal chick called Piyo-Sky.||It's a small light blue stuffed animal.\nApparently, a stuffed animal chick called Piyo-Peach.||It's a small pink stuffed animal.\nApparently, a stuffed animal called Huge-Piyo.||A larger than usual stuffed animal chick.\nA Chinese style panda.||Apparently, its name is Chi-Panda.\nA stuffed animal modeled from a raccoon.||It's name is 'Ara-Ara-kun'.\nApparently, a teddy bear.||For some reason, it has a bandage.\nA stuffed animal based on a dragon.||This is the black version.\nA stuffed animal based on a dragon.||This is the gold version.\nSingle Malt Scotch, Bowmore 40 Years\nSingle Malt Scotch, Yamazaki 25 Years\nSingle Malt Scotch, Yamazaki 12 Years\nSingle Malt Scotch, Hakushu 10 Years\nSingle Malt Scotch, The Macallan 25 Years\nSingle Malt Scotch, The Macallan 12 Years\nSingle Malt Scotch, Laphroaig 15 Years\nSingle Malt Scotch, Bowmore 12 Years\nSingle Malt Scotch, Glenfiddich 12 Years\nScotch Whisky, Hibiki 30 Years Old\nScotch Whisky, NAZO 2003\nScotch Whisky, Suntory Old Whisky\nScotch Whisky, Ballantine's 30 Years Old\nScotch Whisky, Ballantine's 17 Years Old\nScotch Whisky, Ballantine's Finest\nBourbon, Jack Daniel's\nBourbon, Early Times\nBrandy, Suntory Brandy Imperial\nBrandy, Suntory Brandy X.O"
