roma||that dogs come jumping over fences for it.\nA French-made scarf.||Supposedly makes a pleasing gift.\nAn advertising flyer.||It has the opening details of some hostess bar.\nLucky Bracelet. It's a bracelet that's||said to give you luck with women.\nA 10g gold piece.||Selling it would bring in a bit of money.\nA 100g gold piece. Selling it would bring in||a moderate amount of money.\nA 1000g gold piece.||Selling it would bring in a fair amount of money.\nMatches. A rare item nowadays.||I wonder if it has a use.\nAn assortment of snacks.||I wonder if it has a use.\nA bunch of pink lilies.||A pleasing gift for women.\nAn assortment of cookies.||A typical gift.\nSupposedly a high-class Swiss-made watch.||But the workmanship seems a bit shoddy to me.\nA large carpenter's hammer.||The damage upon impact is pretty severe.\nA beer bottle. Powerful as it is but||also powerful when broken, so a handy item to have.\nRope. Depending on the use,||it could be a powerful weapon.\nA kettle. Although it can be used as a weapon,||you can't expect it to be particularly effective.\nA crowbar, so-called nail claw.||Extremely effective as a weapon.\nAn old Chinese sword. It's a little worn, so you||can't really expect too much durability from it.\nA bat. If you hit the ball well, you can probably||make it fly a long distance.\nA lamp. If you hit an enemy with this,||they will probably be rendered blind for a while.\nA golf club... I think I'll try to||improve my swing with this thing.\nA thermos. Well, it's better than using bare hands||is all you can say about a weapon like this.\nA Chinese butcher knife. The knife itself is pretty||heavy, so it's best for chopping.\nIt's a captain's bat. Some captain regularly used||this sturdy bat.\nA lightning bomb. Throwing it can cause the enemy||to become paralyzed.\nA briefcase. It's robust, making||it useful as a weapon.\nMugetsu. The god of darkness lives within||it. It has a cloudy gleam to it.\nSengetsu. The god of thunder lives within||it. It has a dull gleam.\nMyogetsu. The god of fire lives within it.||It has a suspicious gleam."
#: MEDIA/TALK/PAUSE/TALK_PAUSEITEM.BIN:3_2_59
msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/PAUSE/TALK_PAUSEITEM.BIN::line:3_2_59"
msgid "Una bomba incendiaria. Al lanzarla,||puede paralizar al enemigo."
msgstr ""

