#. y1:english="Demon's Fang Sword. This sword has a||very sharp edge. It shines brightly.\nA wooden sword. It's made of oak.||When used skillfully, it's extremely powerful.\nA long dagger. It has a long reach.||It also has powerful striking capabilities.\nA military survival knife.||A true combat knife.\nA stun gun. It can render an enemy powerless||with high voltage electricity.\nA blackjack. Can inflict blows without||leaving any marks.\nTonfa. A globally handy tool for self-defence.||Can inflict heavier blows than bare hands.\nA tactical baton. A striking type weapon.||Easy to handle since it folds up compactly.\nA typical Chinese sword. It bows quite often||so it's a little difficult to handle.\nBrass knuckles, a weapon you wear on your||hands. Old school gangsters used these a lot.\nAlthough it's not engraved, it has a dull||gleam and a good blade.\nA handmade old type automatic pistol.||There's only one bullet in the chamber.\nA stun gun. A popular self-defence weapon.||The battery is almost dead.\nThe dagger that Motomiya is said to have used.||Who is this Motomiya?\nA high quality umbrella. Can also be used as||a weapon. It's pretty durable.\nA gavel. It's a wooden hammer.||It doesn't look very robust.\nA smoke grenade. When thrown, it can render the||enemy blind for a while within a certain area.\nDarts. You can't expect much of a result from||hitting with these. Just try throwing them.\nA saw. As a weapon, it's a little better||than using bare hands.\nAn old automatic pistol. The original is||ancient. It's not that accurate.\nA 9mm automatic pistol. Widespread circulation in||the Far East. Easy to handle and very accurate.\nA doctored lighter. Tinkering with a lighter||has turned it into a mini-flamethrower.\nMusashi Miyamoto's dagger. It's robust. It's||uncertain whether it's genuine or not.\nMifune's Kodachi.||A short sword that has a beautiful sheen to it.\nA tear grenade. When thrown, the enemy's field||of vision can be obstructed within a certain area.\nMace. Spraying it at an enemy will obstruct||their field of vision for a certain amount of time.\nBug spray. Spraying it at an enemy will obstruct||their field of vision for a short while.\nThe knife that Majima Aniki used to use.||It cuts like none other.\nSacred Wooden Sword. Wood from a 100 year||old sacred tree was used to make this sword.\nA mail order cursed sword. Cursed sword...||through mail order...?! What the...?!\nA special tactical baton. When used to||strike, electricity surges into the enemy.\nA dagger that Ninjas used to use.||Lightweight and easy to handle.\nThe engraved sword, Tesshusai. With its rich sheen,||this Japanese sword is a work of art.\nThe cursed sword, Muramasa. There are many anecdotes||about this legendary Japanese sword.\nA shotgun. It's a gun that fires a mass of pellets.||It's very powerful at close range.\nA flash bomb. It obstructs the enemies'||field of vision within a certain range.\nImperial Army grenade. An antique weapon.||Who knows if it will even explode.\nA butterfly knife. Not that powerful, but||good enough for the average thug.\nA 9mm automatic pistol. Widespread in the Far||East. It has a suspicious gleam to it.\nThis is called a Charisma Ring.||It supposedly has the power to draw women to you.\nGoddess' Charm. It's supposed to stop the||enemy from surrounding you in battle.\nPimp Bracelet. Exactly what the name||says it is, but whether or not it works...\nA picture of a famous gangster. If you keep||this on you, you will attract gangsters.\nAs you'd expect of an Italian perfume, it has an||alluring fragrance. It smells pretty good.\nChampion's Ring.||It supposedly sets the enemy's heart on fire...\nMacho Cologne. Apparently it was||produced by extracting male pheromones.\nAngel's Bells. Enemy attacks are somewhat||reduced when equipping these.\nPink nail polish.||Looks like it's of some famous brand name.\nFrench perfume.||Its delicate fragrance is like that of a flower.\nA talisman given to me by Haruka. With this,||I can overcome any adversary.\nCandy given to me by Haruka.||It seems to be a not for sale item.\nChocolate given to me by Haruka.||I've never seen this packaging before.\n777 Talisman. I'm getting the feeling it may||help me get lucky on the slot machines.\nGiven to me by Haruka. Recovers HP and||increases spirit to their maximum capacities.\nA marble with a curious colour tone.||Haruka gave it to me.\nA necklace that Haruka gave me. Wearing it makes me||feel like I'm able to stand up to anything..\nIt's called BANKER Piece.||I wonder what effect it has...\nIt's called PLAYER Piece.||I wonder what effect it has...\nIt's a red gem.||I wonder what effect it has...\nIt's a black gem.||I wonder what effect it has...\nIt's called Blackjack Amulet.||I wonder what effect it has...\nOgre Knuckles. Extremely hard.||Made from a secret mix of metals.\nDragon Knuckles. When you put them on,||power surges through your veins.\nA cedar log used in construction. It looks||like it could break at any moment."
#: MEDIA/TALK/PAUSE/TALK_PAUSEITEM.BIN:3_3_7
msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/PAUSE/TALK_PAUSEITEM.BIN::line:3_3_7"
msgid "Un bastón táctico. Es un arma contundente.||Fácil de manejar ya que se puede plegar."
msgstr ""

