#. y1:english="A bottle of Japanese Sake. Even after it's||broken, it has high striking capabilities.\nAn iron pipe. Durable up to a point and||has moderate attacking power, so it's useful.\nA doctored iron. Inflicts more severe damage||than a mere burn.\nA doctored portable stove. When you hit||someone with this, they catch fire.\nA softball. Very easy to throw. You can't||really expect it to be that effective.\nA kettle. Can be used as a weapon for now,||but you can't expect it to be effective.\nA men's umbrella. Somewhat surprisingly,||it can be used as a weapon.\nA fork. It can be used as a weapon||for the time being.\nA military survival knife. It's kind of an old model||but is totally fine for use in battle.\nAn old dagger. The dagger itself is old but||has a really sharp blade.\nA Chinese sword. A typical Chinese sword.||The workmanship seems a bit shoddy.\nA Chinese Kunai. It's a throwing knife.||Disposable, so it has almost no durability.\nLau family's Chinese sword. Supposedly||a great sword with a sharp edge.\nAn ashtray. While it's at least a hard object,||to fight with this may be considered foolish.\nTable salt. Zero striking power, but handy||for rendering someone temporarily blind.\nPliers. Can be used as a weapon||but probably not that effective.\nAn Iai-do sword. A sword used for fast||drawing techniques. It's powerful.\nA forbidden wood sword. Made of hard wood.||It has more power than most wooden swords.\nThe Bungo Shimizu Sword. Quite a good sword.||It has a razor sharp edge.\nStrawberry shortcake.\nAn expensive looking plate made of gold.||Its value as an antique is appreciable as well.\nA plate made of tortoiseshell. Its elegance as||a piece of art is appreciable as well.\nA plate made of silver.||It has a magnificent and beautiful sheen.\nA plate made of marble.||Probably nice as an ornament.\nA plate with DRAGON written on it. It's the||work of a famous calligrapher.\nA lacquered plate. It's reasonably valuable,||but probably good as a practical item too.\nA golden lighter.||However, it has a cheap sheen to it...\nA bat. If you hit the ball well, you can probably||make it fly a long distance."
#: MEDIA/TALK/PAUSE/TALK_PAUSEITEM.BIN:3_4_6
msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/PAUSE/TALK_PAUSEITEM.BIN::line:3_4_6"
msgid "Un paraguas de hombre. Resulta un poco||sorprendente, pero se puede usar como arma."
msgstr ""

