#. y1:english="dummy\nA cell phone. It was given to me by Detective Date.||Even this is an old model.\nA letter left by Reina.\nThe strip club, Asia's||free-entry pass.\nA coin locker key.\nA fake passport.\nThe membership card to Shangri-la, a really||luxurious Asian massage parlour, aka Soapland.\nHaruka's pendant.||It looks like it can be opened, but it's locked.\nHaruka's pendant.||There was a key inside it.\nThe precious ring that Shinji got back for me.\nThe money collected from Peace Finance.||I better go give it to my Oyabun.\nA mourning badge worn by funeral staff. Only those||wearing it are permitted through the back.\nChips that can be used in the casino.|| \nMedals used at the Volcano pachinko parlour.|| \nWooden Chips used at a gambling parlour.|| \nA picture of Yumi.\nA letter that Fuma Oyabun gave me.\nMasa Sera, the third chairman||of the Tojo Clan's will.\nA letter from Yayoi Dojima.||It says she'll wait at that place from 10 years ago.\nA guy named Motoki forcibly gave me||this briefcase.\nA picture of Mizuki's corpse found floating||in Tokyo Bay. Why did it have to come to this?\nIt's \"some gangster's notebook\". It's a bunch||of notes compiled by one of Majima's men.\nIt's \"Battojutsu (sword drawing technique) Manuscript\".||It was given to me by the Master.\nIt's \"some hitman's diary\".||Some research results on Shimano.\nA book called \"Roundhouse Kick Reader\".||It's 300 pages about roundhouse kick techniques.\nIt's \"Byakuren's notebook\".||It contains the secrets of Lau Ka Long.\nA painting of a bull I bought off a struggling||artist. The bull keeps appearing in his dreams.\nA painting of a lake and a man on a boat.||It represents the painter's cry for help.\nA painting of an egg and a pumpkin I bought off||a struggling artist. It's his masterpiece.\nA painting of a lady holding an onion I bought off||a struggling artist. It's not that good.\nA book I got from an author with writer's block.||It's signed on the inside of the cover.\nA painting of a cat standing on a carrot.||It's the final painting by the struggling artist.\nA resident of Purgatory picked it up.||It seems to contain documents of some kind.\nA pair of tea cups that Kyoka gave to her parents.||Masuko is a town in Tochigi Prefecture.\nThe bag that some woman had.\nGlasses that were given to me by a freezing||homeless person. They are for shortsightedness.\nA picture of Gen's family.\nA coat that was in a coin locker.||It's shabby, but it's warm enough.\nGen's wallet.||There's hardly any money in it.\nA bag that some guy had.\nThe cell phone of the man found murdered||in Park No.3. It has a depressing ringtone.\nA tab built up by a Yakuza in a green suit.||He's run up quite a lot of money on it.\nA paper bag that I'm looking after for some woman.||I was told expressly not to look inside it.\nA manuscript. It has loads of information||written in it.\nAdhesive tape I got from a nearsighted||office worker. It's some sort of super tape.\nA portrait of me that Haruka gave me. It's a little||embarrassing, but pleasing all the same.\nThe ring that Kyoka had.||Ruby, the birthstone for July, is set in it.\nThe handbag that a woman had.||It was snatched away.\nA man called Kyoji Rokkaku's business card.||Maybe it's just me, but it seems to smell a bit...\nA manuscript on the improvement of \"SHIN\",||\"GI\" and \"TAI\".\nA short memo I received from Komaki's apprentice.\nA memo I received from an illegal arms dealer."
#: MEDIA/TALK/PAUSE/TALK_PAUSEITEM.BIN:5_0_43
msgctxt "MEDIA/TALK/PAUSE/TALK_PAUSEITEM.BIN::line:5_0_43"
msgid "Un manuscrito. Contiene mucha||información."
msgstr ""

